
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PAYMENT-ALLOC.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       01 WS-FEES PIC 9(5)V99.
       01 WS-INTEREST PIC 9(5)V99.
       01 WS-PRINCIPAL PIC 9(5)V99.
       01 WS-PAYMENT PIC 9(5)V99.

       01 WS-FEE-PAID PIC 9(5)V99.
       01 WS-INT-PAID PIC 9(5)V99.
       01 WS-PRIN-PAID PIC 9(5)V99.
       01 WS-REMAINING PIC 9(5)V99.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

           DISPLAY "ENTER FEES:"
           ACCEPT WS-FEES

           DISPLAY "ENTER INTEREST:"
           ACCEPT WS-INTEREST

           DISPLAY "ENTER PRINCIPAL:"
           ACCEPT WS-PRINCIPAL

           DISPLAY "ENTER PAYMENT:"
           ACCEPT WS-PAYMENT

           MOVE 0 TO WS-FEE-PAID
           MOVE 0 TO WS-INT-PAID
           MOVE 0 TO WS-PRIN-PAID

           MOVE WS-PAYMENT TO WS-REMAINING

           IF WS-REMAINING >= WS-FEES
               MOVE WS-FEES TO WS-FEE-PAID
               SUBTRACT WS-FEES FROM WS-REMAINING
           ELSE
               MOVE WS-REMAINING TO WS-FEE-PAID
               MOVE 0 TO WS-REMAINING
           END-IF

           IF WS-REMAINING >= WS-INTEREST
               MOVE WS-INTEREST TO WS-INT-PAID
               SUBTRACT WS-INTEREST FROM WS-REMAINING
           ELSE
               MOVE WS-REMAINING TO WS-INT-PAID
               MOVE 0 TO WS-REMAINING
           END-IF

           IF WS-REMAINING >= WS-PRINCIPAL
               MOVE WS-PRINCIPAL TO WS-PRIN-PAID
               SUBTRACT WS-PRINCIPAL FROM WS-REMAINING
           ELSE
               MOVE WS-REMAINING TO WS-PRIN-PAID
               MOVE 0 TO WS-REMAINING
           END-IF

           DISPLAY "FEES PAID: " WS-FEE-PAID
           DISPLAY "INTEREST PAID: " WS-INT-PAID
           DISPLAY "PRINCIPAL PAID: " WS-PRIN-PAID

           DISPLAY "REMAINING PAYMENT: "
                   WS-REMAINING

           STOP RUN.
